OL,3,AHurricane Polo downgraded but remains
OL,4,A'very powerful' off coast of Mexico
OL,5,
OL,6,FHurricane Polo, a large storm off the
OL,7,Fcoast of Mexico, has been downgraded to
OL,8,Fcategory 4 but remains "very powerful",
OL,9,Fthe US National Hurricane Center said.
OL,11,FThe Pacific hurricane, one of the
OL,12,Fstrongest of the season, was projected
OL,13,Fto head towards the coast of
OL,14,Fsouth-western Mexico, bringing intense
OL,15,Fwind and rain, though was not expected
OL,16,Fto make landfall.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
