OL,3,AHurricane Polo downgraded but remains
OL,4,A'very powerful' off coast of Mexico
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Hurricane Hunter aircraft, operated
OL,7,Fby the US National Oceanic and
OL,8,FAtmospheric Administration (Noaa), flew
OL,9,Finto the storm on Tuesday and recorded
OL,10,Fsustained wind speeds near 180 mph (285
OL,11,Fkm/h), with stronger gusts.
OL,13,FThe slow-moving storm is being fuelled
OL,14,Fby extremely warm waters caused by the
OL,15,FEl Nino climate phenomenon.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
